{"id":"n17863-1-3","stage":1,"title":"여기 · 这里","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17863-1-3-1","ko":"여기에 있던 연필 혹시 못 봤어?","zh":"这里原本有的铅笔，你没看见吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기에","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기에","audio":"/audio/89d8715c5ec0d5fb9df5.mp3"}},{"text":"있던","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있던","audio":"/audio/abc85abdfa55b1e0bc82.mp3"}},{"text":"연필","meaning":"铅笔","explanation":"연필：铅笔","readings":[{"term":"연필","audio":"/audio/37db9d0b1c8efc773b03.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67785","senseId":"1","lemma":"연필","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연필","audio":"/audio/37db9d0b1c8efc773b03.mp3"}},{"text":"혹시","meaning":"是不是，是否","explanation":"혹시：是不是，是否","readings":[{"term":"혹시","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87955","senseId":"4","lemma":"혹시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혹시","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"봤어?","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","orig